  "html": "<article id=\"post-65\" class=\"container post-65 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\"><strong>Carolina Heating Service: Greenville’s Partner in Comfort and Care</strong></h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Carolina Heating Service, we’re more than just your local HVAC experts—we’re your neighbors, dedicated to providing the highest quality service to keep your home comfortable year-round. From expertly trained technicians to responsive communication, we’re here to deliver peace of mind with every visit. Discover what sets us apart and why Greenville residents trust us for their heating, cooling, and generator needs.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: -4px;\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-company-portrait-featuring-all-of-the-employees-standing-in-front-of-the-Carolina-Heating-Service-building.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service company portrait, featuring all of the employees standing in front of the Carolina Heating Service building\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left mt-0 h-decorator--white h-decorator-md h-decorator\">Carolina Heating Service | Our Story</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a2f35af1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our company is proud to be a family-operated business dedicated to serving our community with integrity and passion. We know how important it is to have a cozy home during the winter and a cool, refreshing environment during the hot summer months. That’s why we make it our mission to provide top-notch service and expert solutions every time you call us.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What sets Carolina Heating Service apart from the competition? For starters, we believe in delivering every service with a video. This means you can see what’s going on with your HVAC system or whole home generator before we even begin the repair or <a href=\"/maintenance\" title=\"\">maintenance</a> work! We know that transparency matters, and our goal is to make you feel confident in what we do.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When it comes to our team, we pride ourselves on having the right experts for every job. Our technicians are highly trained and experienced, so you can rest assured that we will fix it right the first time. We do not just want to solve problems, but we want to educate our customers too. That way, you can make informed decisions about your HVAC needs.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We also understand that comfort doesn’t just happen during regular business hours. If your heating or cooling system fails in the middle of the night or on a weekend, we’re here for you! Our 24/7 chat feature means you can reach out to us anytime. Whether it’s a question or a service request, we’re just a message away, ready to help!</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Carolina Heating Service, we put our customers first, and we know that many homes require routine maintenance to keep systems running smoothly. That’s where our priority scheduling for maintenance members comes in. By becoming a maintenance member, you’ll enjoy benefits that save you time, stress, and even money! This membership ensures that your HVAC system gets the care it needs to perform at its best, so you can keep your focus on what truly matters &#8211; your family.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We also take love for our community to heart. Being a part of the Greenville area means a lot to us. We believe in giving back and supporting local events and charities. When you choose Carolina Heating Service, you are not just receiving exceptional HVAC service; you are also contributing to the well-being of our community. Together, we can make our town a better place for everyone.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the best things about working with us is that it only takes one call to get everything handled. Whether you need a routine check-up, emergency repairs, or a new HVAC installation, we take care of it all. Our friendly team will guide you every step of the way, explaining your options and answering any questions you may have.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our customer satisfaction is our top priority. We love hearing feedback from our customers about their experiences with Carolina Heating Service. Your happiness is what motivates us to keep improving. We&#8217;ve built our reputation on trust and positive relationships, and our reviews reflect that. When you choose us, you are choosing a team that values your time, money, and peace of mind.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not only do we strive for excellence in the work we do, but we also use high-quality materials and parts in all our services. We know that a properly functioning HVAC system is essential for your home, and we want to ensure you enjoy the comfort it provides for many years to come.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You may be wondering how to get started with Carolina Heating Service. It’s as easy as pie! Our online scheduling lets you pick the best time that fits your routine. You don’t have to wait long for service — just a few clicks, and our team will be on their way to help you.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At the end of the day, our passion for service and commitment to our community drive our actions. We’re here to make sure that you feel cool in the summer and cozy in the winter. Carolina Heating Service is proud to serve Greenville, and we look forward to being your lasting partner in comfort.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So, whether it’s time for a routine check-up or you need urgent assistance, remember that we are always here for you! Let us help you create a comfortable home environment, and together we will keep Greenville feeling great. Thank you for choosing Carolina Heating Service, where your comfort is our mission!</p>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:800\"><strong> &#8211; Torrance Turner, General Manager</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"our-promise container should-overlap should-overlap--secondary\" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/04/NU-CHS-Stock-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Carolina Heating Service building\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Our Promise to You</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\"><p>At Carolina Heating Service, we want every customer to feel confident in choosing us. Here’s what we aim to deliver:</p><ul><li><strong>Unmatched Value:</strong> We combine expert services with transparent pricing to ensure you’re getting the best for your investment.</li><li><strong>Comfort Through Expertise:</strong> With highly certified technicians and a commitment to making you feel at ease, your comfort is our priority.</li><li><strong>Personalized Attention:</strong> From our detailed System Report Card to our personable communication, we’re here to guide you every step of the way.</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications &#038; Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 5;\" data-logo-count=\"5\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocaro