ogocarousel-image\" alt=\"SHA logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4898\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Business Bureau - Accredited Business\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4899\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Esco-Institute-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Esco Institute logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4900\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4901\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SCALT-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SCALT logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4902\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SHA-logo.jpg\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SHA logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4898\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Business Bureau - Accredited Business\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4899\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Esco-Institute-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Esco Institute logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4900\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4901\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"120\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SCALT-logo.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SCALT logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item logocarousel-item--clone\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-logocarousel-item=\"4902\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" src=\"/images/2024/03/SHA-logo.jpg\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"SHA logo\" /></div>                    </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--end\" aria-label=\"See next\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg></button>\n</div></div>\n\n<div id=\"company-cares\" class=\"container splitter py-5 has-background has-secondary-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">About Us</h2>\n\n<p class=\"my-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80);padding-left:0\">Learn more about our team of highly qualified staff, and see why Carolina Heating Service was rated as the most trusted and reliable home service company in the Greenville area.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio has-black-background-color has-white-color text-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<lite-youtube videoid=\"5mqy8dE-vJ8\"></lite-youtube></div>\n</figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"careers\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7\">Careers at Our Company</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Carolina Heating Service is setting up a new standard of HVAC, IAQ, Plumbing, Electrical and Commercial services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our technicians with resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. Come join us; we protect the people and culture that make our branch great while ensuring our customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://jobs.dayforcehcm.com/en-US/nearu/CarolinaHeating\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta my-3\">\n    <span >Open Positions</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border full-height-image mobile-3-2-ratio\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1710\" src=\"/images/2024/04/030624-CHS-3-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Employees smiling and sitting around a table\" class=\"wp-image-5418\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" /></figure>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-inverse-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-4 has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9\">Serving Members of the Upstate for over 43 Years.</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you’re scheduling maintenance, upgrading your system, or dealing with an <a href=\"/about-us/emergency-hvac-cooling-services\" title=\"Emergency Cooling Services in the Surrounding Greenville Metro Area\">emergency</a>, Carolina Heating Service is here to provide reliable, expert care. Call us today to schedule your appointment, and see why we’re Greenville’s go-to choice for heating, cooling, and generator services.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Let us show you the value of service that’s professional, personal, and always there when you need it.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your HVAC Service experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-65 -->"
